0..77 Comment "// A match of no arm over a path whose endpoints hold variables. The naturals"
78..152 Comment "// are free: no rule rewrites a term, so two terms whose first difference,"
153..228 Comment "// read side by side, is two distinct constructors are apart whatever their"
229..303 Comment "// variables hold. That is the unifier\'s conflict rule, disjointness under"
304..378 Comment "// injectivity (Cockx and Devriese, _Proof-relevant unification: dependent"
379..454 Comment "// pattern matching with only the axioms of your type theory_, JFP 2018). A"
455..525 Comment "// presented type\'s open endpoints are refused, in `absurd-not-apart`."
527..548 Comment "// The free naturals."
